"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">11</div><h1>분리동사와 비분리동사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Trennbare und untrennbare Verben</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 11의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">분리동사의 접두어를 문장 끝에 놓아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">비분리 접두어 여덟 개를 알아보고 떼지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">화법조동사·명령형·의문문에서 분리동사의 자리를 지켜요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">um·wieder·über·unter·durch가 분리일 때와 비분리일 때의 뜻을 구별해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;fährt&quot;],[&quot;ab&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Der Bus <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(abfahren)</span> um acht Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">버스는 8시에 출발해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Bus <b>fährt</b> um acht Uhr <b>ab</b>.</div>abfahren은 분리동사예요. fährt가 두 번째 자리, ab은 문장 끝이에요.<br>fahren은 er에서 a → ä로 바뀌어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ruft&quot;],[&quot;an&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Paul <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(anrufen)</span> seine Oma jeden Sonntag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">파울은 매주 일요일에 할머니께 전화해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Paul <b>ruft</b> seine Oma jeden Sonntag <b>an</b>.</div>anrufen → Paul ruft … an. 접두어 an은 문장 맨 끝으로 가요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir gehen heute Abend nicht aus&quot;,&quot;Heute Abend gehen wir nicht aus&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 오늘 저녁에 외출하지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">gehen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">aus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Abend</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir gehen heute Abend nicht aus.</b></div>ausgehen은 분리동사예요. gehen이 두 번째 자리, aus는 맨 끝이에요.<br>nicht는 끝의 접두어 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Machst&quot;],[&quot;auf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(aufmachen)</span> du bitte den Kühlschrank <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">?</div><div class=\"qko\">냉장고 좀 열어 줄래?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Machst</b> du bitte den Kühlschrank <b>auf</b>?</div>Ja/Nein 의문문이라서 Machst가 맨 앞, auf는 문장 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;verkauft&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(verkaufen)</span> sein Fahrrad.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 자기 자전거를 팔아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er <b>verkauft</b> sein Fahrrad.</div>ver-는 비분리 접두어예요. 떨어지지 않고 한 덩어리로 두 번째 자리에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;empfiehlt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Der Kellner <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(empfehlen)</span> uns die Fischsuppe.</div><div class=\"qko\">웨이터가 우리에게 생선 수프를 추천해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Kellner <b>empfiehlt</b> uns die Fischsuppe.</div>emp-는 비분리 접두어예요.<br>empfehlen은 er에서 e → ie로 바뀌어요 — er empfiehlt.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;schlafen&quot;],[&quot;ein&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Meine Kinder <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(einschlafen)</span> um neun Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리 아이들은 9시에 잠들어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Meine Kinder <b>schlafen</b> um neun Uhr <b>ein</b>.</div>einschlafen → sie schlafen … ein. 복수라서 모음이 바뀌지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> 비분리동사는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) mitbringen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) entdecken</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) einladen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) zuhören</button></div><div class=\"qe\">ent-는 비분리 접두어 여덟 개(be·emp·ent·er·ge·miss·ver·zer) 가운데 하나예요.<br>ein-·zu-·mit-는 분리 접두어예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> '그는 매일 6시에 일어나요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er steht auf jeden Tag um sechs Uhr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Er aufsteht jeden Tag um sechs Uhr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Er steht jeden Tag um sechs Uhr auf.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Er steht jeden Tag um sechs Uhr aufstehen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">steht가 두 번째 자리, auf는 문장 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> 강세가 첫 음절(접두어)에 오는 동사는?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) besuchen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) verkaufen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) einkaufen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) erklären</button></div><div class=\"qe\">분리동사는 접두어에 강세가 와요 — EINkaufen.<br>ver-·be-·er- 동사는 어간에 강세가 와요 — verKAUfen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> '나는 우산을 자꾸 잃어버려요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ich verliere immer meinen Schirm.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich verliere meinen Schirm immer ver.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich liere immer meinen Schirm ver.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich lieren immer meinen Schirm ver.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">verlieren의 ver-는 비분리 접두어라서 떨어지지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> (친구에게) '라디오 좀 꺼 줘!' (ausmachen)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Machst bitte das Radio aus!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Mach bitte das Radio aus!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ausmach bitte das Radio!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Mach bitte aus das Radio!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">du 명령형은 동사 부분 Mach가 맨 앞, 접두어 aus는 문장 끝이에요.<br>명령형에는 -st를 붙이지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Das Flugzeug kommt um zehn Uhr an&quot;,&quot;Um zehn Uhr kommt das Flugzeug an&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">비행기는 10시에 도착해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">kommt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Flugzeug</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Uhr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">um</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">zehn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">an</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Das Flugzeug kommt um zehn Uhr an.</b></div>ankommen → kommt가 두 번째 자리, an은 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Heute lade ich meine Freunde ein&quot;,&quot;Ich lade heute meine Freunde ein&quot;,&quot;Meine Freunde lade ich heute ein&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘 나는 친구들을 초대해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">meine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">lade</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Freunde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">ein</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Heute lade ich meine Freunde ein.</b></div>einladen → lade가 두 번째 자리, ein은 맨 끝이에요.<br>Heute가 첫 자리면 주어 ich는 동사 뒤로 가요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> (손님에게) '이 서류를 기입해 주세요.' (ausfüllen)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Bitte ausfüllen Sie das Formular.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Bitte füllen Sie das Formular aus.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bitte füllt Sie das Formular aus.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Bitte füllen Sie aus das Formular.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Sie 명령형은 동사 + Sie … 접두어 순서예요.<br>füllt는 ihr의 형태예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hast&quot;],[&quot;vor&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Was <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(vorhaben)</span> du heute Abend <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">?</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘 저녁에 뭐 할 계획이야?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Was <b>hast</b> du heute Abend <b>vor</b>?</div>vorhaben은 haben에 vor-가 붙은 분리동사예요 — du hast … vor.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> '내일 여동생을 데려올 수 있어?' (mitbringen)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Kannst du morgen mitbringen deine Schwester?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Kannst du morgen deine Schwester mitbringen?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Bringst du morgen deine Schwester mitbringen?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Kannst du morgen deine Schwester bringen mit?</button></div><div class=\"qe\">화법조동사와 함께 쓰면 분리동사는 원형으로 끝에 가고, 접두어가 다시 붙어요 — … mitbringen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Macht&quot;],[&quot;aus&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ausmachen · ihr에게 명령)</span> jetzt das Licht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">! Es ist schon spät.</div><div class=\"qko\">(아이들에게) 너희 이제 불 꺼! 벌써 늦었어.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Macht</b> jetzt das Licht <b>aus</b>! Es ist schon spät.</div>ihr 명령형은 ihr 현재형에서 ihr를 뺀 모양이에요 — Macht!<br>접두어 aus는 문장 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> '내일 다시 올게요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ich komme morgen wieder.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich komme wieder morgen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich wiederhole morgen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich wiederkomme morgen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'다시 오다'는 분리동사 WIEderkommen이에요. wieder는 문장 끝으로 가요.<br>wiederholen(반복하다)은 비분리이고 뜻이 달라요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> '그녀는 계약서에 서명해요.' (unterschreiben)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Sie unterschreibt den Vertrag.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Sie schreibt unter den Vertrag.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Sie unter schreibt den Vertrag.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Sie schreibt den Vertrag unter.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">unterSCHREIben(서명하다)은 강세가 어간에 있는 비분리동사예요. 떨어지지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;fängt&quot;],[&quot;an&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Der Kurs <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(anfangen)</span> nächste Woche <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">강좌가 다음 주에 시작해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Kurs <b>fängt</b> nächste Woche <b>an</b>.</div>anfangen은 분리동사이고, fangen은 er에서 a → ä로 바뀌어요 — er fängt … an.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gibt&quot;],[&quot;zurück&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Er <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(zurückgeben)</span> seiner Mutter das Geld <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 어머니에게 돈을 돌려드려요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er <b>gibt</b> seiner Mutter das Geld <b>zurück</b>.</div>zurückgeben → er gibt … zurück. geben은 er에서 e → i로 바뀌어요.<br>받는 사람은 3격(seiner Mutter), 돌려주는 것은 4격(das Geld)이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Du musst heute dein Zimmer aufräumen&quot;,&quot;Heute musst du dein Zimmer aufräumen&quot;,&quot;Dein Zimmer musst du heute aufräumen&quot;,&quot;Du musst dein Zimmer heute aufräumen&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 오늘 네 방을 정리해야 해.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Zimmer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">aufräumen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">musst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">dein</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">heute</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Du musst heute dein Zimmer aufräumen.</b></div>화법조동사 musst가 두 번째 자리, 원형 aufräumen이 맨 끝이에요.<br>원형으로 끝에 갈 때는 접두어가 붙어 있어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Kommst du heute Abend mit&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너 오늘 저녁에 같이 갈래?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Abend</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Kommst</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Kommst du heute Abend mit?</b></div>mitkommen → Ja/Nein 의문문이라서 Kommst가 맨 앞, mit은 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ich setze den Brief über. (편지를 번역해요)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich bereite heute das Abendessen vor. (저녁을 준비해요)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wir lernen heute unsere Nachbarn kennen. (이웃을 알게 돼요)</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Im Winter geht die Sonne früh unter. (겨울에는 해가 일찍 져요)</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'번역하다'는 비분리 überSETzen이에요 — Ich übersetze den Brief.<br>vorbereiten은 vor만 떨어지고, kennenlernen은 kennen이 끝으로 가요. '해가 지다'는 분리 UNtergehen이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;kommt&quot;],[&quot;an&quot;],[&quot;hole&quot;],[&quot;ab&quot;],[&quot;kaufen&quot;],[&quot;ein&quot;],[&quot;besucht&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Morgen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(ankommen)</span> meine Tante <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">. Ich <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(abholen)</span> sie um zehn Uhr <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\">. Am Nachmittag <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 5\"><span class=\"qh\">(einkaufen)</span> wir zusammen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 6\">. Am Abend <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 7\"><span class=\"qh\">(besuchen)</span> sie das Museum.</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 이모가 도착해요. 나는 10시에 이모를 데리러 가요. 오후에 우리는 함께 장을 봐요. 저녁에 이모는 박물관에 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Morgen <b>kommt</b> meine Tante <b>an</b>. Ich <b>hole</b> sie um zehn Uhr <b>ab</b>. Am Nachmittag <b>kaufen</b> wir zusammen <b>ein</b>. Am Abend <b>besucht</b> sie das Museum.</div>ankommen·abholen·einkaufen은 분리동사라서 접두어가 문장 끝으로 가요.<br>besuchen은 be- 비분리동사라서 떨어지지 않아요 — sie besucht.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;steigen&quot;],[&quot;um&quot;],[&quot;umarmt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> Wir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(umsteigen)</span> in Frankfurt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">. Meine Mutter wartet dort und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(umarmen)</span> mich.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 프랑크푸르트에서 갈아타요. 어머니가 거기서 기다리다가 나를 안아 줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir <b>steigen</b> in Frankfurt <b>um</b>. Meine Mutter wartet dort und <b>umarmt</b> mich.</div>UMsteigen(갈아타다)은 분리 — wir steigen … um.<br>umARmen(껴안다)은 비분리 — sie umarmt mich.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> (친구에게) '이 편지를 끝까지 읽어 봐!' (durchlesen)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Durchlies den Brief!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Lest den Brief durch!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Liest den Brief durch!</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Lies den Brief durch!</button></div><div class=\"qe\">DURCHlesen(끝까지 읽다)은 분리동사예요.<br>lesen의 du 명령형은 Lies!이고, durch는 문장 끝이에요. Lest는 ihr 명령형이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Warum rufst du deinen Vater heute nicht an&quot;,&quot;Warum rufst du heute deinen Vater nicht an&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 왜 오늘 아버지께 전화하지 않아?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">an</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">rufst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Warum</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Vater</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">deinen</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Warum rufst du deinen Vater heute nicht an?</b></div>의문사 + rufst + 주어, 접두어 an은 맨 끝이에요.<br>nicht는 끝의 접두어 바로 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Kommt&quot;],[&quot;mit&quot;],[&quot;können&quot;],[&quot;mitkommen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> „<input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(mitkommen)</span> ihr morgen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">?“ – „Nein, wir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(können)</span> leider nicht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\">. Wir besuchen unsere Großeltern.“</div><div class=\"qko\">&quot;너희 내일 같이 갈래?&quot; – &quot;아니, 아쉽지만 같이 못 가. 우리는 조부모님 댁을 방문해.&quot;</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · „<b>Kommt</b> ihr morgen <b>mit</b>?“ – „Nein, wir <b>können</b> leider nicht <b>mitkommen</b>. Wir besuchen unsere Großeltern.“</div>현재형에서는 mit이 떨어져 끝으로 가요 — Kommt ihr … mit?<br>화법조동사와 함께면 원형이 붙어서 끝에 와요 — können … mitkommen.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"